WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,480
They are only allowed to rob us, and we are not allowed to resist

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:06,480
His elder brother died, and he deserved it

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:12,920
Mom, will Brother Wenwen die?

4
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,520
He even bought me candy

5
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:22,034
How is it

6
00:00:22,034 --> 00:00:32,890
Can it be saved?

7
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:36,720
There are a lot of wounds, so I can only treat the dead horse as a living horse doctor.

8
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:44,010
What a pity

9
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:51,580
Xiaofan, you must hold on

10
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,780
Don't let strangers get close anymore
